        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una baya que puedes lanzar a un Pokémon salvaje\npara tranquilizarlo un poco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かわいさに　みがきを　かける　ための\nポロックを　つくるとき　つかわれる。\nももいろの　みは　たべると　あまい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "귀여움을 연마하기 위한\n포켓몬스넥을 만들 때 사용된다.\n담홍색 열매는 먹으면 달다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作用於增進可愛的\n寶可方塊時使用。\n粉紅色的果實嘗起來是甜的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Baie rose au goût sucré, utilisée pour préparer\ndes Pokéblocs permettant d’augmenter la Grâce\nd’un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Beerensorte, die als Zutat für Pokériegel\nverwendet wird, welche die Putzigkeit erhöhen.\nIhr rosa Fruchtfleisch schmeckt süßlich.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se utiliza en la producción de Pokécubos que potencian\nla dulzura. Es de color rosa y sabor dulce.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bacca rosa dal sapore dolce usata per creare\nPokémelle che aumentano la Grazia del Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Used to make Pokéblocks that will enhance your\nCuteness. Its pink flesh is sweet when eaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かわいさに　磨きを　かける　ための\nポロックを　つくるとき　使われる。\n桃色の実は　食べると　甘い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用于制作宝可方块，\n制作出来的宝可方块可用来打磨可爱。\n粉红色的果实尝起来是甜的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se utiliza en la producción de Pokécubos que potencian\nla dulzura. Es de color rosa y sabor dulce.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポフィンの　ざいりょう。 ふかふかのつちに　うめると ナナが　そだつ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포핀의 재료. 푹신푹신한 땅에 심으면 나나가 자란다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作寶芬的材料。 埋進鬆軟的泥土裡， 長成後會結出蕉香。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient entrant dans la confection de Poffins. Plantez cette Baie dans un sol meuble et fertile pour faire pousser un arbre à Baies Nanab.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Knursp-Zutat. Pflanze sie in weichen Lehmboden ein, damit neue Nanabbeeren wachsen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ingrediente para pokochos. Si se planta en tierra suelta, saldrá una planta de Latano.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si usa per fare i poffin. Seminala nella terra soffice per far crescere una pianta di Baccabana.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poffin ingredient. Bury it in soft soil to grow a Nanab Berry plant.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポフィンの　材料。 ふかふかの土に　埋めると ナナが　育つ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/23/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "宝芬的材料。 埋在松软的土地里 可以培育出蕉香。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "brilliant-diamond-shining-pearl",
